awnix offline-update trust store (vendor half)
==============================================

Installed to /usr/share/awnix/offline-trust.d/. The admin half is
/etc/awnix/offline-trust.d/ (writable; `awnix offline-update trust add <hex64>`).

Only files named *.pub count. The first non-comment line of each must be a
64-hex-character Ed25519 public key (awseal's hex form; `awseal pubkey`). This
README is never read as a key.

A bundle whose awseal signature is valid but whose signer is not listed in either
directory is REFUSED (reason untrusted-key) before anything is staged.

This directory is EMPTY on purpose until the owner mints the production offline
signing key (a B2 trust anchor) and bakes its public half here as
aitherium-offline-<year>.pub. Until then check_awnix_offline_update.py OFU007 is
allowlisted, and a node only accepts bundles signed by a key its admin added.

The private key never exists on a node or in this repository.
